{"id":"02910c90a7bc9f14","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-cfg-positive-closure.md","title":"Positive Closure Properties of Context-Free Languages","display":"thm-context-free-positive-closure — Positive Closure Properties of Context-Free Languages","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-cfg-positive-closure","aliases":["73-thm-cfg-positive-closure","73-thm-context-free-positive-closure"],"display":"thm-context-free-positive-closure — Positive Closure Properties of Context-Free Languages","depends_on":["[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","[[73-df-cfg-language-class]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-cfg-positive-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-cfg-positive-closure</span><span>73-thm-context-free-positive-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-context-free-positive-closure — Positive Closure Properties of Context-Free Languages"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"83639a9615c06195\" href=\"?note=83639a9615c06195\" title=\"73-df-cfg-language-class\">73-df-cfg-language-class</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>；字母与有限词的类型见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_1,L_2\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(L_1,L_2\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> (context-free languages, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"83639a9615c06195\" href=\"?note=83639a9615c06195\" title=\"73-df-cfg-language-class\">73-df-cfg-language-class</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}context\\text{-}free\\text{-}positive\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\nL_1\\cup L_2\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}context\\text{-}free\\text{-}positive\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\nL_1\\cup L_2\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}context\\text{-}free\\text{-}positive\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\nL_1\\cdot L_2\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}context\\text{-}free\\text{-}positive\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\nL_1\\cdot L_2\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}context\\text{-}free\\text{-}positive\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\nL_1^*\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}context\\text{-}free\\text{-}positive\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\nL_1^*\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>After renaming nonterminals apart, fresh-start productions combine the two grammars for union and concatenation; a recursive fresh-start production gives star.</li>\n<li>The star operation includes the empty word through the explicit clause <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_1^0=\\{\\varepsilon\\}\">\\(L_1^0=\\{\\varepsilon\\}\\)</span> in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>.</li>\n<li>Intersection and complement are intentionally absent because the class is not closed under them.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-language-class","status":"resolved","id":"83639a9615c06195","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-language-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $\\Sigma$ 满足 $\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$；字母与有限词的类型见 [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-language-class","status":"resolved","id":"83639a9615c06195","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L_1,L_2\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}$ (context-free languages, see [[73-df-cfg-language-class]])","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"The star operation includes the empty word through the explicit clause $L_1^0=\\{\\varepsilon\\}$ in [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"L_1,L_2\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}context\\text{-}free\\text{-}positive\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\nL_1\\cup L_2\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}context\\text{-}free\\text{-}positive\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\nL_1\\cdot L_2\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}context\\text{-}free\\text{-}positive\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\nL_1^*\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}","display":true},{"tex":"L_1^0=\\{\\varepsilon\\}","display":false}],"bytes":1525,"backlinks":[{"id":"68b47b6e126cab37","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"08a47204ea81e603","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["0a6da8c909717780","83639a9615c06195"]}